          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You swore a vow to shelter others from the First World's cruelties. Wise to fey's mind-affecting abilities, your vow grants mental resistance equal to half your level (minimum 1), and a +2 circumstance bonus to Nature checks to Recall Knowledge about fey.</p><hr /><p><strong>Additional Edict</strong> confront cruel fey you encounter (as long as you have a reasonable chance of success)</p>"
          },
